se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nYang Guo is a history teacher in a community middle school, he has a student team that is humble and serious, and their grades in all subjects are very superior. He just leads them to win the first place in a city-wide history knowledge competition. This achievement attracts wide attention and praise in the community.\n\n[Question]\nYang Guo should be proud of the students' victory, why does he feel worried?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Yang Guo worries that his students become complacent after winning the award.\nB. Yang Guo worries that this competitive activity may put too much pressure on the students.\nC. Yang Guo thinks the award may cause jealousy and dissatisfaction among other teachers.\nD. Yang Guo worries that the award of this competition makes the students neglect the study of other subjects.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002182656149400383,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e305d6006945d280421d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368261512,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:37:41","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"d192f7f56bf04b95b727f7b304625e34"}